Thank you for your interest in joining the Mainspring Energy network! We are excited about the prospect of partnering with you.
As part of our standard onboarding process, we require all prospective partners to complete our Referral Partner Due Diligence Questionnaire and Certification. This step ensures mutual compliance and sets up a transparent, successful foundation for our partnership.
Please complete your questionnaire by clicking the secure link below:
